---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/pages-extra.css';
import '../styles/inline-about-.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={"About | AJ Car Detailing | Mobile Detailing Ashburn, VA"}
  description={"One detailer. Every car. Learn about AJ Car Detailing — a fully mobile shop based in Ashburn, Virginia."}
  transparentHeader={true}
>
  
  <main id="main">
   <section class="page-hero" aria-label="About hero"> <div class="page-hero__media"> <video src="/detailing/videos/hero-detail-03.mp4" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/detailing/images/work/hero-detail-03.jpg" aria-hidden="true"></video> <div class="page-hero__veil"></div> </div> <div class="container page-hero__inner"> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">About The Shop</span> <h2 class="page-hero__title">One Detailer.<br><span class="page-hero__accent">Every Car.</span></h2> <p class="page-hero__lead">No subcontractors. No call centres. When you book AJ, AJ shows up. Same hands on every job, same standard every time.</p> </div> </section>  <section class="section story"> <div class="container story__layout"> <div class="story__copy" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">The Story</span> <h2>Started With A Bucket. Built On Obsession.</h2> <p>AJ Car Detailing began the way most good things do. One vehicle, one driveway, one obsession with getting it right. What started as friends and family asking for a hand turned into a fully mobile shop covering Ashburn, Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon and Reston.</p> <p>The mission has not changed. Every car gets treated like it is the only one we will touch all week. The interior gets pulled apart. The exterior gets decontaminated, polished, protected. The reveal is the best part of the job.</p> <a href="/detailing/#book" class="btn btn--accent btn--large">Book A Detail <span class="btn__arrow">&rarr;</span></a> </div> <div class="story__media" data-reveal="right"> <img src="/detailing/images/work/on-site.jpg" alt="Black truck after a full AJ's exterior detail" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"> <div class="story__media-badge"> <span>Ashburn, Virginia</span> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section values"> <div class="container"> <div class="section-head section-head--center" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">What We Stand For</span> <h2>The Standard Is The Standard.</h2> </div> <div class="values__grid" data-stagger="100"> <div class="value-card" data-reveal> <span class="value-card__num">01</span> <h4>We Come To You</h4> <p>Fully mobile across Ashburn, Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon and Reston. Driveway, workplace, home. No appointment hassle.</p> </div><div class="value-card" data-reveal> <span class="value-card__num">02</span> <h4>Showroom Quality Finish</h4> <p>Every car treated like our own. Hand washed, hand polished, hand finished. No shortcuts, no excuses.</p> </div><div class="value-card" data-reveal> <span class="value-card__num">03</span> <h4>Premium Products</h4> <p>Professional grade chemicals, microfibers and ceramic coatings. The same products top studios use, brought to your driveway.</p> </div><div class="value-card" data-reveal> <span class="value-card__num">04</span> <h4>Real Local Owner</h4> <p>AJ runs every job personally. You deal directly with the detailer, never a call centre.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section stats-section"> <div class="container"> <div class="stats-section__grid" data-stagger="120"> <div class="stat-block" data-reveal> <span class="stat-block__value" data-counter="500">0</span> <span class="stat-block__label">Cars Detailed</span> </div><div class="stat-block" data-reveal> <span class="stat-block__value" data-counter="100">0</span> <span class="stat-block__label">Mobile Service</span> </div><div class="stat-block" data-reveal> <span class="stat-block__value" data-counter="5">0</span> <span class="stat-block__label">Star Rated</span> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="section areas"> <div class="container areas__layout"> <div data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">Where We Work</span> <h2>Mobile Across Ashburn, Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon &amp; Reston.</h2> <p>Based in Ashburn. On the road every week across Leesburg, Sterling, Herndon, Reston and back. If you are in the area, we can get to you.</p> </div> <ul class="areas__list" data-stagger="80"> <li data-reveal>Ashburn</li> <li data-reveal>Leesburg</li> <li data-reveal>Sterling</li> <li data-reveal>Herndon</li> <li data-reveal>Reston</li> </ul> </div> </section>  <section id="contact-cta" class="section contact-cta"> <div class="container"> <div class="contact-cta__layout"> <div class="contact-cta__copy" data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark">Get In Touch</span> <h2>Ready When You Are.</h2> <p>Send a few photos, get an honest quote. Most details booked the same week.</p> <ul class="contact-cta__list"> <li><span class="contact-cta__label">Call or Text</span><a href="tel:+17039361803">(703) 936-1803</a></li> <li><span class="contact-cta__label">Email</span><a href="mailto:ajcardetailz@gmail.com" class="contact__value">ajcardetailz@gmail.com</a></li> </ul> </div> <div data-reveal="right"> <div class="contact-form-wrapper"> <form class="contact-form" action="#" method="post" data-demo-form> <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New AJ Car Detailing Website Lead"> <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="name">Name <span class="form-required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label> <input type="text" id="name" name="name" class="form-input" placeholder="Your full name" required aria-required="true" autocomplete="name"> </div> <div class="form-row"> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="email">Email <span class="form-required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label> <input type="email" id="email" name="email" class="form-input" placeholder="you@email.com" required aria-required="true" autocomplete="email"> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="phone">Phone</label> <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" class="form-input" placeholder="(519) 555 1234" autocomplete="tel"> </div> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="vehicle">Vehicle</label> <input type="text" id="vehicle" name="vehicle" class="form-input" placeholder="Year, make and model" autocomplete="off"> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="service">Service</label> <select id="service" name="service" class="form-select"> <option value="" disabled selected>Pick a service</option> <option value="Interior Detailing">Interior Detailing</option> <option value="Exterior Detailing">Exterior Detailing</option> <option value="Full Detail">Full Detail</option> <option value="Paint Correction">Paint Correction</option> <option value="Ceramic Coating">Ceramic Coating</option> <option value="Not sure yet">Not sure yet</option> </select> </div> <div class="form-group"> <label class="form-label" for="message">Details</label> <textarea id="message" name="message" class="form-input" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us about your vehicle and what you would like done"></textarea> </div> <button type="submit" class="contact-form__submit"> <span class="contact-form__submit-text">Send Request</span> <span class="contact-form__submit-sending">Sending</span> </button> <p class="contact-form__small">Or text photos of your vehicle straight to <a href="tel:+17039361803">(703) 936-1803</a> for the fastest quote.</p> </form> <div class="contact-form__success" style="display:none" role="status" aria-live="polite"> <div class="contact-form__message contact-form__message--success"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path> <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline> </svg> <p>Request received. AJ will be in touch shortly to confirm timing and quote.</p> </div> </div> <div class="contact-form__error" style="display:none" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"> <div class="contact-form__message contact-form__message--error"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle> <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"></line> <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"></line> </svg> <p>Something went wrong. Call or text (703) 936-1803 and we will get back to you fast.</p> <button type="button" class="contact-form__retry">Try Again</button> </div> </div> </div>   </div> </div> </div> </section>  
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
